# --- Misc ---
wget-log*
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- Keep small generated reports tracked (negate ignores above) ---
!results/reports/
!results/reports/**
!artifacts/mappers/**/reports/
!artifacts/mappers/**/reports/**
